## IDs ##


<div class="example terminal cozy">&lt;!DOCTYPE html>
&lt;html>
&lt;head>
  &lt;title>Seletores&lt;/title>
  &lt;link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css" type="text/css">
  &lt;style>
     p { font-size: large; }
     .strong { font-weight: bold; }
     <span class=focus><u>#important</u> { color: red; }</span>
  &lt;/style>
&lt;/head>
&lt;body>
    &lt;p class=strong> Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, ...&lt;/p>
    &lt;p> Praesent vel elementum nunc...  &lt;/p>
    <span class=focus>&lt;p class=strong <u>id=important</u>>  Donec cursus orci ...  &lt;/p></span>
&lt;/body>
&lt;/html>
</div>


* Seletor é o <b>id</b> do elementos
* Precedido de um cardinal <span class=litle>(<span class=focus>#</span>)</span>
* Aplica-se apenas ao **único** elemento associado a esse **id**
* Com o atributo <span class=focus>id</span> com mesmo nome
